      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>A blessing for announcing the new moon of Elul, for Rosh Ḥodesh Elul, and for the whole month. A poem of kindness, rootedness and transformation as we enter into a time of turning and returning.</tei:p>
        <tei:p>You can find more writing like this at Writing by Ilana Joy Streit (Facebook page).</tei:p>
        <tei:p>[If you have the means, please consider making a financial contribution to recognize and compensate Ilana for her creative work. You can see and hear more of Ilana’s creative work on her Patreon page. Or to make a one-time contribution, Venmo (@Ilana-Streit).]</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_33270_notes"/>
